{"file": "D:\\SpaceBook\\_cls6_jpg\\geo\\054.jpg", "lines": [{"text": "EffectsofClimate", "conf": 0.933, "box": [[83, 81], [335, 74], [336, 105], [84, 112]]}, {"text": "Followingaresomeofthemain impacts:", "conf": 0.917, "box": [[83, 160], [551, 146], [552, 179], [84, 192]]}, {"text": "(A)ImpactsonEconomy", "conf": 0.91, "box": [[87, 211], [389, 199], [390, 231], [88, 244]]}, {"text": "activities. Agriculture in Pakistan include the crop growing activity, livestock, and fisheries:", "conf": 0.953, "box": [[115, 291], [1182, 267], [1183, 309], [116, 333]]}, {"text": "plains.", "conf": 0.864, "box": [[118, 382], [202, 375], [205, 410], [121, 417]]}, {"text": "industries. These industries employ a large part of the population.", "conf": 0.9, "box": [[120, 455], [881, 440], [882, 483], [121, 498]]}, {"text": "well toearnforeignexchange.", "conf": 0.908, "box": [[123, 585], [465, 575], [466, 605], [124, 614]]}, {"text": "andcherries.", "conf": 0.849, "box": [[120, 668], [274, 664], [275, 694], [121, 698]]}, {"text": "Appleorchard", "conf": 0.908, "box": [[579, 975], [722, 971], [723, 998], [580, 1002]]}, {"text": "Cotton field", "conf": 0.838, "box": [[961, 968], [1089, 963], [1090, 990], [962, 995]]}, {"text": "Maize field", "conf": 0.857, "box": [[213, 979], [328, 976], [328, 1002], [214, 1005]]}, {"text": "Sugarcane", "conf": 0.897, "box": [[666, 1250], [771, 1250], [771, 1277], [666, 1277]]}, {"text": "Textileindustry", "conf": 0.896, "box": [[967, 1241], [1130, 1239], [1131, 1266], [967, 1268]]}, {"text": "Livestock", "conf": 0.834, "box": [[267, 1255], [365, 1255], [365, 1282], [267, 1282]]}, {"text": "(B)Impacts.on Lifestyle", "conf": 0.91, "box": [[90, 1306], [382, 1304], [383, 1334], [91, 1336]]}, {"text": "o Climate of Pakistan has a direct impact on density and distribution of population in the", "conf": 0.901, "box": [[84, 1350], [1198, 1331], [1198, 1367], [85, 1386]]}, {"text": "country. The plains are heavily populated. Harsh climate areas like deserts and cold", "conf": 0.919, "box": [[116, 1390], [1198, 1369], [1199, 1405], [117, 1427]]}, {"text": "mountains are much thinlypopulated.", "conf": 0.883, "box": [[116, 1430], [550, 1426], [551, 1456], [116, 1459]]}, {"text": "o Impact of climate in Pakistan is much apparent in people's dress. Cotton dresses in hot areas", "conf": 0.951, "box": [[84, 1469], [1200, 1454], [1200, 1493], [85, 1508]]}, {"text": "andwoolendressesincoldareas.", "conf": 0.934, "box": [[118, 1512], [494, 1511], [494, 1537], [118, 1538]]}, {"text": "o Diversity of climate has led to the construction of airy and flat-roofed houses in the warm", "conf": 0.936, "box": [[86, 1553], [1196, 1541], [1196, 1574], [87, 1586]]}, {"text": "areas. In thecoldareasless ventilated andsloped-roof houses are constructed.", "conf": 0.908, "box": [[115, 1593], [1024, 1586], [1024, 1616], [115, 1623]]}, {"text": "50", "conf": 0.544, "box": [[609, 1653], [648, 1653], [648, 1685], [609, 1685]]}, {"text": "Unit 3: Climatic Regions of the World", "conf": 0.922, "box": [[834, 1647], [1195, 1640], [1195, 1674], [835, 1681]]}]}